{"id": "85884", "name": "גזירה סתומה – זיהוי u, v, w בנגזרת של ay^m+bxⁿ·sin(cy)=de^(fx)+g (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>The derivative of the function \\(y\\) satisfying</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>is of the form</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>where</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(u\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:Result]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:v]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:w]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Differentiate both sides with respect to \\(x\\) (chain rule for the terms in \\(y\\), product rule for \\(x^n\\sin(cy)\\)), solve for \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\), and compare with the given form.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Differentiating implicitly</b><br><p>Differentiating both sides of the equation with respect to \\(x\\) we obtain</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} \\frac{dy}{dx} + {{CT:5}} + {{CT:6}} \\frac{dy}{dx} = {{CT:7}}\\mbox{.} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Solving for \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\)</b><br><p>Collecting the terms in \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\) on one side we have that</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx}\\left({{CT:8}}\\right) = {{CT:9}} \\]</p><p>and so</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx} = {{CT:10}}\\mbox{.} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Reading off \\(u\\), \\(v\\) and \\(w\\)</b><br><p>We see that</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle u&\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle {{CT:7}}\\mbox{,}\\\\ v&\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle {{CT:11}}\\mbox{,}\\\\ w&\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle {{CT:12}}\\mbox{.} \\end{array} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ux", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "DIF-IMP-TRUE-U", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "DIF-IMP-FALSE-U", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "malux", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "EXPONENTIAL_ARGUMENT_WRONG", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">The argument of your exponential is incorrect.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "UNIDENTIFIED_ERROR", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "v", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "vx", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "DIF-IMP-TRUE-V", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "DIF-IMP-FALSE-V", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "w", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "fe